silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_05_biologist_entry_point_concrete_anchor_0#speciesapex_mittens silm:hasLongDescription "The SpeciesApex_Mittens is the species apex for Mittens: Felis catus as a governed colimit position; the typed species ROLE into which Mittens is placed (NOT Mittens identity). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'SpeciesApex_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
